.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Ko-hyoteki_Sydney.jpg/500px-Ko-hyoteki_Sydney.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Ko-hyoteki_Sydney.jpg/500px-Ko-hyoteki_Sydney.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A Japanese Kō-hyōteki class midget submarine M-21 being raised from Taylor's Bay on 1 June 1942","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AKo-hyoteki_Sydney.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/54/Sydneycityscape.jpg/500px-Sydneycityscape.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/54/Sydneycityscape.jpg/1280px-Sydneycityscape.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/54/Sydneycityscape.jpg/500px-Sydneycityscape.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The Harbour as seen aloft from the Tasman Sea","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASydneycityscape.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/001syd_harbour2008-9.JPG/500px-001syd_harbour2008-9.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/001syd_harbour2008-9.JPG/1280px-001syd_harbour2008-9.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/001syd_harbour2008-9.JPG/500px-001syd_harbour2008-9.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The harbour is the focal point for the Sydney New Year's Eve celebrations.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A001syd_harbour2008-9.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wiki